# Probe for the private-instance gate. The setup wizard and the admin settings fetch probe.txt and read which file answers: "rewritten" means this server applies rewrite rules from .htaccess, which is what the _data/.htaccess gate of a private instance needs. "static" means it ignores them, and an error means Apache refuses them.
<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>
    RewriteEngine On
    RewriteRule ^probe\.txt$ rewritten.txt [L]
</IfModule>
